e": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [290, 330], "pos": [318.27783203125, 6058.69140625], "widgets_values": ["acdcc7b5694819dee111445165d75bce7174056bf5af401248ac64f21c813dfb.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 152, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "Ref Image 5", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [279], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["<Picture 1> defines the first keyframe: an unfolded ancient bamboo scroll in the center, surrounded by a semi-transparent quantum probability cloud with particles flickering in and out, haze blue and ink green palette.\n<Picture 2> defines the middle keyframe: a superposition sphere simultaneously showing a clear defined state on the left half and a dissolving particle fog state on the right half, deep space gradient background with pale golden glow.\n<Picture 3> defines the final keyframe: a glowing sphere whose surface text symbols are melting and drifting away as particles, surrounded by empty speech bubble outlines, expressing that language cannot fully define ultimate essence, warm gray and haze blue palette.\n<Picture 4> defines the first keyframe: an upright book in the center with a cover design of Tai Chi diagram overlapping quantum waveform patterns, a minimalist scholar silhouette beside it holding a writing brush, ink green and pale gold accents on warm gray background.\n<Picture 5> defines the middle keyframe: left side showing a quantum superposition diagram with one particle existing in two positions simultaneously, right side showing vacuum energy fluctuation ripples appearing and disappearing randomly, haze blue main tone with pale golden energy dots.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Flat-style scientific illustration, low-saturation Morandi palette, haze blue and warm gray dominant with pale gold and ink green accents, clean minimal composition, subject centered, soft diffused lighting, serene and contemplative atmosphere. An unfolded ancient bamboo scroll sits in the center of the frame, abstract line symbols on its surface representing ancient text, surrounded by a semi-transparent quantum probability cloud with particles flickering in and out of existence. The camera slowly pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed, focusing on the bamboo scroll, the probability cloud gently shifts and particles flicker. [Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the camera cuts to a superposition sphere in the center, its left half showing a sharp defined outline and its right half dissolving into a scattered particle fog, deep space gradient background with pale golden subtle glow surrounding it. The sphere slowly rotates, the particle fog on the blurred side gently drifts and dissipates. [Shot 3] At 00:06.000, the camera cuts to a glowing sphere in the center, text symbols on its surface are actively melting and drifting upward as particles, several empty speech bubble outlines float around it with nothing inside, expressing that language cannot exhaust ultimate essence. The text particles slowly rise and scatter, the camera slowly pulls out. [Shot 4] At 00:09.000, Flat-style scientific illustration, low-saturation Morandi palette, haze blue and warm gray dominant with pale gold and ink green accents, clean minimal composition, subject centered, soft diffused lighting, serene and contemplative atmosphere. An upright book stands in the center of the frame, its cover displaying a Tai Chi diagram overlapping with quantum waveform patterns, a minimalist scholar silhouette stands beside it holding a writing brush as if writing. The book gently glows, the camera slowly pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. [Shot 5] At 00:12.000, the camera cuts to a split composition: on the left, a quantum superposition diagram showing one particle existing in two positions simultaneously; on the right, vacuum energy fluctuation ripples randomly appearing and disappearing in empty space. Haze blue main tone with pale golden energy light dots. The camera slowly pans right, the ripples and particles pulse and shift rhythmically.\n\n\noverall_soundscape: Subtle resonant hum, soft crackling as particles flicker, gentle airy whooshing as symbols dissolve and drift upward.\nnon_diegetic_music: Minimal ambient piano with soft sustained pads at a slow tempo, contemplative and mysterious, gradually thinning toward the end.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1521.72216796875, 6618.69140625], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["16:9 (Widescreen)", 0.1, 32], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "title": "Resolution Selector